# Normalize text files to LF on every checkout, independently of the
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Go tooling (gofmt) and CI assume LF;
# a CRLF worktree makes gofmt report the whole tree as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.a binary
*.lib binary
